ubservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Tile &amp; Coping Replacement</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Tile and coping upgrades that enhance pool safety, aesthetics, and long-term structural protection.</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"cms-item-subservices w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"item-subservice\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-equipment-upgrades/icon-3remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Pool Equipment Upgrades</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Modern pool equipment upgrades that improve circulation, filtration, and overall system efficiency.</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"cms-item-subservices w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"item-subservice\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/led-pool-lighting-systems/icon-4remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">LED Pool Lighting Systems</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Energy-efficient LED pool lighting designed to enhance visibility, ambiance, and nighttime safety.</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"cms-item-subservices w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"item-subservice\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/structural-pool-repairs/icon-5remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Structural Pool Repairs</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Professional pool repairs addressing cracks, leaks, and structural issues for lasting performance.</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"cms-item-subservices w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"item-subservice\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-deck-hardscape-remodeling/icon-6remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Pool Deck Resurfacing</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Pool deck resurfacing services that improve safety, appearance, and outdoor functionality.</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"cms-item-subservices w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"item-subservice\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-finishes-interior-surface-installation/icon-7remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Spa Remodeling &amp; Integration</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Spa remodeling and integration services that complement pool renovations for added comfort.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"process-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dce80844-cc8a-923f-8fa1-aa91c1419f9a\" class=\"process-header\"><h2>Our Pool Renovation Process</h2><p data-w-id=\"dce80844-cc8a-923f-8fa1-aa91c1419f9d\">Our licensed pool contractors manage inspection, demolition, installation, and finishing for renovations that meet Florida safety codes throughout.</p></div><div class=\"process-steps-nav\"><div class=\"process-step-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"process-step-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">1</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">2</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">3</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">4</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"line-bar\"></div></div><div class=\"process-content-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"process-content-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Our pool remodeling experts evaluate your pool condition, discuss your renovation goals, and create a fully customized plan to restore and upgrade your outdoor space in Florida.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-remodel-step-1/pool-remodel-step-1.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Pool Assessment &amp; Condition Analysis</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Detailed inspection identifying plaster delamination, structural cracks, equipment aging, circulation inefficiencies, and aesthetic improvements needed. We use underwater camera inspection to assess interior conditions and plan targeted renovations.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Old tile, coping, and worn materials are safely removed. Structural repairs are completed and the pool surface is professionally prepared for a flawless, long-lasting new finish.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-remodel-step-2/pool-remodel-step-2.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Renovation Design &amp; Material Selection</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Design consultation for modernization including updated finishes, enhanced circulation systems, lighting upgrades, and deck resurfacing options. We present 3D renderings showing before/after transformations.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"New tile, coping, updated decking, energy-efficient equipment, and custom features are installed by skilled pool remodeling contractors using premium Florida-rated materials.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-remodel-step-3/pool-remodel-step-3.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Permits &amp; Project Coordination</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Acquisition of renovation permits and coordinated scheduling with utility providers. For major renovations, Notice of Commencement filing and ARB re-approval may be required.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Bond Kote prep, new interior finish, water fill, and full chemistry balance — your renovated Florida pool is tested, certified, and ready for immediate use and enjoyment.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-remodel-step-4/pool-remodel-step-4.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Renovation Execution &amp; System Upgrades</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Full renovation including surface restoration, equipment replacement, circulation upgrades, and integration of smart automation systems for enhanced functionality and energy efficiency.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"w-embed w-script\"><script>\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n\n  const AUTOPLAY_DELAY = 5000;\n\n  const COLOR_ACTIVE   = '#001C63';\n  const COLOR_INACTIVE = '#D99933';\n\n  const dots  = document.querySelectorAll('.process-step-item');\n  const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.process-content-item');\n\n  if (!dots.length || !steps.length) return;\n\n  let currentStep = 0;\n  let autoTimer   = null;\n  let isAnimating = false;\n\n  function goToStep(index) {\n    if (isAnimating) return;\n    isAnimating = true;\n\n    const prevStep = currentStep;\n    currentStep = index;\n\n    // ── 1. Actualizar DOTS (nav) ──────────────────────────\n    dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {\n      const circle = dot.querySelector('.tab-circle, [class*=\"tab-circle\"], [class*=\"Tab-Circle\"]');\n      const number = dot.querySelector('[class*=\"step-number\"], [class*=\"Step-Number\"]'); // ✅ DENTRO de goToStep\n\n      if (!circle) return;\n\n      if (i === currentStep) {\n        circle.style.background = COLOR_ACTIVE;\n        circle.style.transform  = 'scale(1.15)';\n        circle.style.boxShadow  = '0 4px 16px rgba(0,28,99,0.25)';\n        circle.style.transition = 'all 0.35s ease';\n        if (number) number.style.color = '#FFFFFF'; // ✅ Blanco activo\n      } else {\n        circle.style.background = COLOR_INACTIVE;\n        circle.style.transform  = 'scale(1)';\n        circle.style.boxShadow  = 'none';\n        circle.style.transition = 'all 0.35s ease';\n        if (number) number.style.color = '#001C63'; // ✅ Navy inactivo\n      }\n    });\n\n    // ── 2. Animar salida del paso anterior ────────────────\n    if (steps[prevStep] && prevStep !== currentStep) {\n      const outEl = steps[prevStep];\n      outEl.style.transition = 'opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease';\n      outEl.style.opacity    = '0';\n      outEl.style.transform  = 'translateY(-10px)';\n\n      setTimeout(function () {\n        outEl.style.display = 'none';\n        showCurrentStep();\n      }, 300);\n    } else {\n      showCurrentStep();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function showCurrentStep() {\n    steps.forEach(function (s) {\n      s.style.display = 'none';\n      s.style.opacity = '0';\n    });\n\n    const activeEl = steps[currentStep];\n    if (!activeEl) { isAnimating = false; return; }\n\n    activeEl.style.display   = 'flex';\n    activeEl.style.transform = 'translateY(12px)';\n    activeEl.style.opacity   = '0';\n\n    void activeEl.offsetWidth;\n\n    activeEl.style.transition = 'opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease';\n    activeEl.style.opacity    = '1';\n    activeEl.style.transform  = 'translateY(0)';\n\n    setTimeout(function () { isAnimating = false; }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function startAutoplay() {\n    stopAutoplay();\n    autoTimer = setInterval(function () {\n      const next = (currentStep + 1) % dots.length;\n      goToStep(next);\n    }, AUTOPLAY_DELAY);\n  }\n\n  function stopAutoplay() {\n    if (autoTimer) { clearInterval(autoTimer); autoTimer = null; }\n  }\n\n  dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {\n    dot.style.cursor = 'pointer';\n    dot.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      if (i === currentStep) return;\n      stopAutoplay();\n      goToStep(i);\n      startAutoplay();\n    });\n  });\n\n  const section = document.querySelector('.process-section');\n  if (section) {\n    section.addEventListener('mouseenter', stopAutoplay);\n    section.addEventListener('mouseleave', startAutoplay);\n  }\n\n  goToStep(0);\n  startAutoplay();\n\n});\n</script></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design3-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design3-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design3-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design3.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"255\"></section>";
