"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">What energy savings can pool upgrades provide?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Variable-speed pool pumps can reduce energy use by up to 90%, delivering major long-term savings for Florida homeowners. When combined with modern LED pool lighting, automated chemical dosing, and energy-efficient filtration, a complete equipment upgrade dramatically reduces the annual cost of pool ownership.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How long does a pool remodel take in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Renovation timelines vary by project scope, but most Florida pool remodels are completed within four to eight weeks from permit approval through final finishing. Minor resurfacing projects may be faster, while equipment replacements or structural upgrades require additional time for permit processing and county inspections.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can features be added during a pool renovation?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Pool renovations are an ideal time to add spas, tanning ledges, waterfalls, LED lighting, and smart automation systems. Our licensed pool contractors manage the permitting and installation of all additions alongside the renovation work, keeping your project coordinated and on schedule.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do you offer financing options for outdoor projects?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">We partner with trusted lending providers to offer structured financing for pool remodeling, renovation, and equipment upgrades. Florida homeowners with projects from targeted resurfacing to full-scale transformations can explore payment plans that make a high-quality renovation accessible without compromising on materials or craftsmanship.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section></div><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Whe